 # Mech Project Website
 
 This is the project website for the Mech programming language, which you can find here: https://gitlab.com/cmontella/mech
+
+The Benchmark Explorer is served at https://mech-lang.org/benchmarks/ from
+`public/benchmarks/`. Its static assets and qualified measurement data come from
+`benchmarks/clbg/overview/explorer/dist/` on the Mech repository's
+`codex/clbg-native-benchmarks` branch. Copy the complete directory for updates;
+keep the sibling modules, data, source audits, downloads and license files
+together. The existing Pages job publishes `public` when `main` is pushed.
